// Dedushka combat test bed on Eden (Everon), the airfield, daylight. Written by
// hand from nothing. One stock player (West) and two parked, unarmed, captive
// anchor soldiers (East and Resistance): a side that has a unit in the mission
// has its centre and its friend table set up by the engine, which a centre made
// by script does not. Resistance is hostile to both sides here (resistanceWest
// and resistanceEast are 0), so a creature in a Resistance group is everyone's
// enemy. The tests make the creature and every shooter from script. One East
// rifle section (kjcF1..3) is placed here, 135 m west of where he stands: only a
// group loaded from a mission has its flee strength computed, and the death test
// needs a group the engine can make run. The other tests delete it.
// addOns[] names the creature's addon: a runtime createUnit of a class whose
// owner addon is not activated is refused, and no script command activates one.
version=11;
